isfrutar de inmejorables vistas de la montaña. GUIA DEL CORREDOR FICHA TÉCNICA Día: 7 de Noviembre 2026 Distancia: 12,4km Salida y llegada: Collbató (360m) Hora de salida: 10:00h Punto más alto del recorrido: Pla de San Miquel (854m) Desnivel positivo: 600M+ AVITUALLAMIENTOS Av.1 Pla de San Miquel | Km 7 Av.2 Llegada Contenido: Agua, isotónico, fruta y frutos secos. ENTREGA DE DORSALES EL CASSINET Passeig Mansuet, s/n Collbató Viernes 6 de 17h a 20h Sábado 7 de 8:45h a 9:45h CIRCUITO RECORRIDO PERFIL TRACK RECORRIDO PERFIL TRACK Powered by Wikiloc INSCRIPCIONES","links":["https://cursalba.cat/carrera-mitjalba-collbato/width=device-width,%20initial-scale=1","https://gmpg.org/xfn/11","https://consent.cookiebot.com/uc.js","https://cursalba.cat/carrera-mitjalba-collbato/","https://cursalba.cat/ca/cursa-mitjalba-collbato/","https://cursalba.cat/feed/","https://cursalba.cat/comments/feed/","https://cursalba.cat/wp-json/oembed/1.0/embed?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcursalba.cat%2Fcarrera-mitjalba-collbato%2F&","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/themes/hello-elementor/assets/css/reset.css?ver=3.5.1","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/themes/hello-elementor/assets/css/theme.css?ver=3.5.1","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/themes/hello-elementor/assets/css/header-footer.css?ver=3.5.1","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/css/frontend.min.css?ver=4.2.3","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/uploads/elementor/css/post-6.css?ver=1787805956","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/css/widget-image.min.css?ver=4.2.3","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/plugins/elementor-pro/assets/css/widget-nav-menu.min.css?ver=4.2.2","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/plugins/elementor-pro/assets/css/modules/sticky.min.css?ver=4.2.2","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/css/widget-social-icons.min.css?ver=4.2.3","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/css/conditionals/apple-webkit.min.css?ver=4.2.3","https://cursalba.cat/wp-content/plugins/elem